  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_7289f4354f654ffca0589dfec2ae2d57",
      "statement": "The supervised ControlNet stage ships an observe-only in-training paired-fidelity monitor: `PairedFidelityCallback` lives in `src/manifold/metrics/paired_callback.py`, is registered by the supervised ControlNet CLI as the `paired_fidelity` callback through `PairedFidelitySpec`, and logs `val/psnr` / `val/ssim` while checkpoint selection stays on the latent-space `val/x0_mae`; the callback never enters the loss and never touches the optimizer or EMA.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/paired_callback.py#L54-L120",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5d830e558fa8b7993c80ecf882966f8435e48cab74dfeb51ab22aa0b1e6a5b49:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/training/callbacks/paired_fidelity.py#L37-L75",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f2c1ea738cb913432c8fc19ed929cc447fc6b8195dbf2e0a98c356ed65fd0e8b:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/training/controlnet_cli.py#L168-L195",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:010d22c7eac4863f41845005207d786cfb9b48d1da21c28acedcd1c021b2c251:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b2b60207c53b4302a521a2014f27d042",
      "statement": "The in-training paired-fidelity monitor reuses the existing decode and metric path instead of parallel machinery: `VaeStage` stages the VAE for the decode, `LatentDecoder` decodes, `min_max_to_unit` normalizes each volume to [0,1], and `PairedFidelityMetrics` (MONAI 3D PSNR/SSIM, data_range 1.0) scores the result — the same helpers the offline before/after comparison uses, so the in-training curve and the offline number are comparable.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/paired.py#L34-L66",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:63ba2b62f6a540d4a824f5d4e19571e2699658897e9a0f2bacac56064883a963:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/metrics/paired_callback.py#L170-L215",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:159d32fd6a4c175a27a025a751652b98974c68034d2f9bf04af3f30d7495fed5:"
        },
        {
