    {
      "id": "claim_8f3b9d34eca34cc0b6773bbec32d1401",
      "statement": "The monitor scores a fixed, seeded paired-validation subset that it resolves lazily from the datamodule via `getattr(datamodule, \"val_latent_ds\", datamodule)`, so the cold path's post-`setup()` replacement of `val_latent_ds` is honored; under DDP every rank evaluates that same subset redundantly and the only cross-rank reduction is Lightning's torchmetrics sync on the module-attached MeanMetrics.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/data/datamodule.py#L36-L50",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:820c9959eb581621009b52869d4d62e26dc1c0f543c2370282ff1c2f1a7d2618:"
        },
        {
