        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_200363a868114a1eac88dce12d331703",
      "statement": "On the GRPO stage the unconditional FID callback is skipped for a ControlNet policy and force-removed post-merge through `forbidden_callbacks` / `forbidden_monitors`, with checkpoint selection on the conditional `val/mean_reward`; the paired-fidelity monitor is not registered on that stage, which ADR-0037 leaves as a deliberate follow-up.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/training/core.py#L110-L135",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:68280e7d6c28d0a2f4a916e50781e36f6f52987605f729b03372a19d3ffc19ef:"
        },
        {
