        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_c0ce3dd3ba9a49fa97b2f13dc9d9d101",
      "statement": "Experiment configuration is a launch-time OmegaConf layer: env, train, and network YAML are merged so that later files replace earlier top-level blocks wholesale, `_base_` is the explicit per-file deep-merge inheritance layer, and CLI flag overrides then Hydra-style dotlist overrides layer on top; the composed config only builds components and never persists, while persisted component configuration is JSON handled by `ConfigMixin`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/config/builder.py#L20-L96",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:680be2a7f201bb98e61802c637b44344087f364b721571526b2dda3882ecb1eb:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/config/loader.py#L62-L167",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:eea76aed62afee9f50f9d1a4a61c3fe0a5c9ac32ccb62a93a6e5f573b5e32131:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/configuration.py#L63-L92",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:81c7666edfc4138b7c9c7253b8d43077dc1598cba555d655bf4c2bf564d93c34:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0f062393708c4c26919070191399665b",
      "statement": "Native inference artifacts are self-describing per-component directories: `model_index.json` names the `pipeline_class` and its components and each component writes its own config and weights into its subdirectory; Lightning `.ckpt` files are training state that pipelines never load, and `export_to_native` is the bridge that bakes checkpoint weights into a native directory (a supervised-ControlNet export bakes only the `controlnet.*` keys and passes the frozen base UNet through).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/pipelines/latent_flow.py#L56-L105",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f460955842098eeb8b6b965030268f3a8a20f2c5316eb0d4f9ed74112510328c:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/manifold/training/export.py#L40-L117",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b816ac76bf9abc46ce67c5b371fe4d703595c3947a199aa9a529ae33b53e39ee:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5a2a4e7b8cc54e0ea957ec3f635f3223",
      "statement": "The evaluation CLI infers the policy from the before artifact's `model_index.json` `pipeline_class` instead of a mode flag, and writes the after policy to `<output>/after_native` through that same export bridge before reloading both sides into fresh pipelines.",
