        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_09db98460ba045a295a8d19f40276d4b",
      "statement": "BraTS discovery is the only dataset-specific code on the paired path (grouping volumes by subject and contrast and enumerating the ordered non-self contrast pairs), and the shared subject-level train/val splitter `_train_val_manifests` lives in `src/manifold/data/paired_manifests.py`, consumed by both the ControlNet supervised CLI and the GRPO CLI.",
